{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And do not seek Bethel</b> — for the calf is there, and it is the seat of Jeroboam's kingdom." "<b>It shall become Aven</b> — the vav is in place of the yod, like 'and you shall be (ואתה הוה) a king over them.' Behold, the hand of YHWH is הויה. Or it is as it sounds, for in the end it will be called so.\n\nn: 'the hand of YHWH is הויה' is textually difficult; possibly a truncated or corrupt phrase, translated hyper-literally."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:05.412432747Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}